OL,3,GNEWSACity road closures for River of
OL,4,ALight festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople travelling around Liverpool city
OL,7,Fcentre are being advised of travel
OL,8,Fdisruption as the River of Light
OL,9,Ffestival returns.
OL,11,FTens of thousands of visitors are
OL,12,Fexpected for the annual light
OL,13,Finstallation trail along the waterfront
OL,14,Fand in the city centre which runs from
OL,15,FFriday until 1 November.
OL,17,FDisruption includes temporary road
OL,18,Fclosures on Water Street and there will
OL,19,Fbe traffic management in place during
OL,20,Fthe festival.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
